+*   $2^\omega \cdot \lceil \log_2 \lambda \rceil$: Bits for the palette (worst-case size $2^\omega$ entries, each $\lceil \log_2 \lambda \rceil$ bits).
+*   $\text{size}(\text{directory entry})$: Overhead for the block directory entry [S1].
